{"slug":"news/genesis-mission-partnership","title":"Working with the US Department of Energy \\ Anthropic","desc":"A multi-year partnership with the DOE's Genesis Mission deploys Claude and custom scientific tools across the 17 national laboratories.","main":"<div class=\"\"><article class=\"EaEYjq_Article\" style=\"opacity:1\"><header class=\"VYxBBq_Header\" style=\"visibility: visible; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"VYxBBq_Content\"><h1 class=\"VYxBBq_Title\">Working with the US Department of Energy to unlock the next era of scientific discovery</h1></div><div class=\"VYxBBq_MetalistContainer\" style=\"--metalist-columns:3\"><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Metalist\"><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Published</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><time datetime=\"2025-12-18\">Dec 18, 2025</time></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Category</p><p class=\"text-caption-1\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" href=\"/news/partnerships\">Partnerships</a></p></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_Metadata\"><p class=\"text-caption-1\">Topics</p><ul class=\"VYxBBq_Wrap\"><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=discovery\">Discovery</a></li><li class=\"\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=partnerships\">Partnerships</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_ThirdTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=government-capacity\">Government capacity</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=democratic-lead\">Democratic lead</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=life-sciences\">Life sciences</a></li><li class=\"VYxBBq_HiddenTopic\"><a class=\"wN10Da_link\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=agents\">Agents</a></li></ul><button class=\"VYxBBq_TopicSeeMore text-caption-1\">See more...</button